# Documents module (contracts/openapi/documents.yaml). Run auth.http, tenant.http (locationId) and sales.http
# (cardBillId) first. A print agent uses the device token of the shop PC (iam.http, auth.http) as deviceToken.

### A default receipt template: shop name first, then the address (tenant module, DOC-06)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/receipt-templates
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{$uuid}}

{"name": "Counter", "paperWidthMm": 80, "language": "en", "isDefault": true,
 "header": {"lines": ["Lanka Mart", "12 Main Street, Kandy"]},
 "footer": {"lines": ["Thank you, come again"]},
 "fields": {"phone": "081 222 3344", "showQr": true, "openDrawerOnCash": true}}

### Preview a bill's receipt as text (DOC-01, DOC-02)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/documents/receipts:render
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{$uuid}}

{"format": "TEXT", "billId": "{{cardBillId}}", "paperWidthMm": 58}

### The same receipt as a PDF
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/documents/receipts:render
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{$uuid}}

{"format": "PDF", "billId": "{{cardBillId}}"}

>> receipt.pdf

### Register the shop PC's print agent at the location
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/print-agents
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{$uuid}}

{"locationId": "{{locationId}}", "name": "Counter PC", "printerModel": "Epson TM-T20III", "paperWidthMm": 80}

> {% client.global.set("agentId", response.body.id); %}

### The template the agent caches to print offline (DOC-06)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/print-agents/{{agentId}}/template
Authorization: Bearer {{deviceToken}}

### Reprint the bill: a COPY queued for the location's agent (DOC-05)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/bills/{{cardBillId}}/reprint
Authorization: Bearer {{cashierToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{$uuid}}

{}

### The agent long-polls for its next job (204 when none arrived within waitSeconds)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/print-agents/{{agentId}}/jobs:next?waitSeconds=25
Authorization: Bearer {{deviceToken}}

> {% client.global.set("jobId", response.body.id); %}

### The agent reports the result
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/print-jobs/{{jobId}}/result
Authorization: Bearer {{deviceToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{$uuid}}

{"status": "PRINTED", "printerStatus": "ONLINE"}

### Print agents of the location
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/print-agents?locationId={{locationId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}
